00074:       "lines": [
00075:         678,
00076:         718
00077:       ],
00078:       "fact": "Sell rejection checks important/price<=0 before quantity. Quantity begins1, explicit chosen5 differs default1. Commit old money→setter clamp→actual increase stat→unchecked per-item removals→feedback/refresh. Cancel/refusal before commit writes no sale state.",
