00093:       ],
00094:       "fact": "Entry normalizes each supplied stock element in place and deletes important already owned; menu references same array. canSell flag changes commands. Both ordinary exits clear entire temporary price table; errors/abnormal return have no guaranteed cleanup. No automatic stock reconstruction.",
00095:       "contracts": [
