00174:       "fact": "setPrice strict-resolves item, lazily initializes [-1,-1]; buy writes only>0, explicit sell>=0 stores double, absent sell copies positive buy. Nonpositive buy does not reset existing slots; setSellPrice requires two arguments and delegates buy=-1. Game_Temp mart_prices initialized/cleared {}.",
