00188:         123
00189:       ],
00190:       "fact": "Player creation directly takes Metadata.start_money, while later money/BP/coins/soot setters clamp0..configured max. StartMoney can exceed wallet maximum until a write, including successful free purchase that writes money-0. BP earned setter statistics separate from shop spending.",
